{"term": {"label": "道", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-ii", "title": "滕文公下", "description": "陳代曰：「不見諸侯，宜若小然；今一見之，大則以王，小則以霸。且志曰：『枉尺而直尋』，宜若可為也。」\n孟子曰：「昔齊景公田，招虞人以旌，不至，將殺之。志士不忘在溝壑，勇士不忘喪其元。孔子奚取焉？取非其招不往也，如不待其招而往，何哉？且夫枉尺而直尋者，以利言也。如以利，則枉尋直尺而利，亦可為與？昔者趙簡子使王良與嬖奚乘，終", "occurrences": 16, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仕", "id": "仕"}, {"form": "伐", "id": "伐"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "古", "id": "古"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "家", "id": "家"}, {"form": "往", "id": "往"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "承", "id": "承"}, {"form": "數", "id": "數"}, {"form": "枉", "id": "枉"}, {"form": "正", "id": "正"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "由", "id": "由"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "聖", "id": "聖"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "道", "variants": [], "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.3397743454849977, "source": "聖", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.7376696182833684, "source": "聖", "target": "承"}, {"weight": 2.8213788864092133, "source": "從", "target": "枉"}, {"weight": 2.032921526044943, "source": "從", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.7376696182833684, "source": "從", "target": "數"}, {"weight": 2.6390573296152584, "source": "仕", "target": "古"}, {"weight": 2.6390573296152584, "source": "仕", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 2.9267394020670396, "source": "惡", "target": "由"}, {"weight": 1.6274564179367788, "source": "惡", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.332204510175204, "source": "惡", "target": "伐"}, {"weight": 4.02535169073515, "source": "惡", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.7227665977411035, "source": "天下", "target": "正"}, {"weight": 1.4350845252893227, "source": "天下", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 0.6241543090729939, "source": "天下", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.116630794170788, "source": "天下", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.7227665977411035, "source": "天下", "target": "受"}, {"weight